WEBVTT

08:33.254 --> 08:35.005
Birthday guests at three o'clock!

08:35.089 --> 08:37.215
Stay calm, everyone!

08:37.300 --> 08:38.759
Hey!

08:40.803 --> 08:41.803
Meeting adjourned.

08:41.888 --> 08:44.306
Ho, boy! Will you take a look
at all those presents?

08:44.974 --> 08:46.808
I can't see a thing.

08:50.062 --> 08:53.023
Yes, sir, we're next month's
garage sale fodder for sure.

08:53.107 --> 08:55.942
-Any dinosaur-shaped ones?
-Oh, for crying out loud.

08:56.027 --> 08:59.154
-They're all in boxes, you idiot.
-They're getting bigger.

08:59.238 --> 09:01.531
Wait, there's a nice
little one over there.
